    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"stopping for a minute\" doesn't change the fact that when I start again, everything is still exactly the same. it's just a loop. i feel like i'm just running in circles and getting nowhere, and eventually, the only way to actually stop the loop is to just... stop. it feels like the only way to actually get peace is to just end the struggle entirely.",
